# Token efficiency

- Prefer targeted file reads and ripgrep over opening whole trees.
- Do not dump large logs, lockfiles, build artifacts, or generated code into context.
- Use Context7 MCP for library/API docs (Python, Android/Kotlin, Swift/iOS, ESP-IDF, Raspberry Pi / Linux) instead of guessing APIs.
- Use GitHub MCP only when repo/issue/PR operations are needed.
- Keep answers concise; avoid restating the task.
- Never commit secrets (`creds`, `.env`, keys, tokens).
